L38: \nL39: 温馨提醒：图片仅供参考，商品以实物为准\nL40: \nL41: 收藏\nL42: \nL43: 对比\nL44: # VNL5050N3TR-E\nL45: \nL46: 全保护型低端驱动器\nL47: \nL48: 描述\nL49:     OMNIFET III全保护下桥臂驱动器\nL50: \nL51: 品牌名称\nL52:     cite34†ST(意法半导体)†list.szlcsc.com L53: \nL54: 商品型号\nL55:     VNL5050N3TR-E\nL56: \nL57: 商品编号\nL58:     C2680415\nL59: \nL60: 商品封装\nL61:     SOT-223​\nL62: \nL63: 包装方式\nL64:     编带\nL65: \nL66: 商品毛重\nL67:     0.22克(g)\nL68: \nL69:   * 数据手册\nL70: ## 商品参数\nL71: \nL72: [Button: 查看类似商品]\nL73: \nL74: [Input]  | 属性  | 参数值\nL75: --- | --- | ---\nL76: [Input]  | 商品目录  | 功率电子开关\nL77: [Input]  | 类型  | 低侧开关\nL78: [Input]  | 通道数  | 1\nL79: [Input]  | 输入控制逻辑  | 高电平有效\nL80: [Input]  | 工作电压  | 3.5V~5.5V\nL81: \nL82: [Input]  | 属性  | 参数值\nL83: --- | --- | ---\nL84: [Input]  | 最大连续电流  | 19A\nL85: [Input]  | 导通电阻  | 50mΩ\nL86: [Input]  | 功能特性  | 短路保护；过流保护；过温保护；过压保护\nL87: [Input]  | 工作温度  | -40℃~+150℃\nL88: ## 商品概述\nL89: \nL90: VNL5050N3-E和VNL5050S5-E是采用VIPower技术制造的单片器件，用于驱动一侧连接到电池的电阻性或电感性负载。 内置热关断功能可保护芯片免受过温和短路影响。输出电流限制可在过载情况下保护器件。在长时间过载的情况下，器件会将耗散功率限制在安全水平，直至热关断介入。具备自动重启功能的热关断可使器件在故障条件消失后立即恢复正常运行。关断时可实现电感性负载的快速去磁。\nL91: \nL92: ## 商品特性\nL93: \nL94:   * 符合汽车级标准\nL95:   * 漏极电流：19 A\nL96:   * ESD保护\nL97:   * 过压钳位\nL98:   * 热关断\nL99:   * 电流和功率限制\nL100:   * 极低的待机电流\nL101:   * 极低的电磁敏感度\nL102:   * 符合欧洲指令2002/95/EC\nL103:   * 开漏状态输出（仅VNL5050S5-E具备）\nL104: ## 数据手册PDF\nL105: \nL106: cite35†放大查看 cite36†下载PDF†atta.szlcsc.com L107: \nL108: cite37†iframe†atta.szlcsc.com L109: \nL110: [Button: 相似推荐][Button: 其他推荐]\nL111: \nL112:   * cite38†STMPS2252MTR L113:   * cite39†VND5050AJTR-E L114:   * cite40†VND5T035LAKTR-E L115:   * cite41†VND5012AKTR-E L116:   * cite42†VN751STR L117:   * cite43†VN540SPTR-E L118:   * cite44†VN5016AJTR-E L119:   * cite45†VND1NV04TR-E L120:   * cite46†VND3NV04TR-E L121:   * cite47†VNS14NV04PTR-E L122:   * cite48†VB525SPTR-E L123:   * cite49†L9362013TR L124:   * cite50†VNQ810PTR-E L125:   * cite51†VNQ7040AYTR L126:   * cite38†STMPS2252MTR L127:   * cite39†VND5050AJTR-E L128:   * cite40†VND5T035LAKTR-E L129:   * cite41†VND5012AKTR-E L130:   * cite42†VN751STR L131:   * cite52†SLG59M1714VTR L132:   * cite53†TPS2065DDBVT L133:   * cite54†TCK22913G,LF L134:   * cite55†NX20P3483UKAZ L135:   * cite56†TPS22964CYZPT L136:   * cite57†TPS22924CYZPT L137:   * cite58†TCK322G,LF L138:   * cite59†TCK321G,LF L139:   * cite60†BTS3110N L140:   * cite61†TPS22915CYFPT L141:   * cite62†ITS711L1FUMA1 --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FOME-Tech/Polygonus/b3176cb1de7d0f5b9380ecebc1d007e2f365a6de/README.md)\nciteturn3view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/plain; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FOME-Tech/Polygonus/b3176cb1de7d0f5b9380ecebc1d007e2f365a6de/README.md\",\"lineno\":30}); Total lines: 158\nL23: - 11x analog voltage inputs (weak pulldown to ground to avoid floating)\nL24: - 4x analog temperature inputs (2.7k pullup resistor to 5v)\nL25: - 8x digital inputs with integrated 2.7k pullup resistor to 5v. Two of these are labeled as VR inputs, but this is for compatibility with Proteus. All 8 use identical hardware on Polygonus.\nL26:     - Directly wire to hall cam/crank sensors\nL27:     - Use with a VR interface on the base board\nL28:     - Use for a digital input (oil pressure switch, driver switches and buttons, etc)\nL29: - 2x knock sensor inputs (AC coupled, 1-15khz bandwidth)\nL30: ## Outputs\nL31: - 12x 4A low-side drivers, LS1-8 + LS13-16. No freewheel diodes, mount on the base board as required.\nL32: - 8x unassigned direct-to-MCU outputs LS9-12 and IGN9-12. Mount injector/ignition drivers on the base board if you have a V12, or use these for something else.\nL33: - 8x 5v ignition (or general purpose) outputs IGN1-8. 5v push-pull, 100mA DC maximum.\nL34: - 2x direct-to-MCU pins for electronic throttle H-bridges on base board.\nL35: - 4x 12v 3A high-side outputs HS1-4.\nL36: ## Power Supply\nL37: \nL38: - Full operation from 6-24v supply\nL39: - Limited operation from 4-6v\nL40: - Dual 5v sensor supplies, 150mA each, fully protected\nL41: - Dual protected 12v external sensor supply\nL42: \nL43: # Pinout\nL44: \nL45: ## Pin Types\nL46: \nL47: **Lowside**:\nL48: ## Table\nL49: | Pin | Signal | Type |\nL50: |-----|--------|------|\nL51: | 1 | Ground | |\nL52: | 2 | Ground | |\nL53: | 3 | 12V_MR | 12v supplied from main relay. Supplies high side outputs. |\nL54: | 4 | LS1 | Lowside output |\nL55: | 5 | LS2 | Lowside output |\nL56: | 6 | LS3 | Lowside output |\nL57: | 7 | LS4 | Lowside output |\nL58: | 8 | LS5 | Lowside output |\nL59: | 9 | LS6 | Lowside output |\nL60: | 10 | LS7 | Lowside output |\nL61: | 11 | LS8 | Lowside output |\nL62: | 12 | IGN12 | Passthrough to MCU |\nL63: | 13 | IGN11 | Passthrough to MCU |\nL64: | 14 | IGN10 | Passthrough to MCU |\nL65: | 15 | IGN9 | Passthrough to MCU |\nL66: | 16 | IGN8 | 5v push-pull output |\nL67: | 17 | IGN7 | 5v push-pull output |\nL68: | 18 | IGN6 | 5v push-pull output |\nL69: | 19 | IGN5 | 5v push-pull output |\nL70: | 20 | IGN4 | 5v push-pull output |\nL71: | 21 | IGN3 | 5v push-pull output |\nL72: | 22 | IGN2 | 5v push-pull output |\nL73: | 23 | IGN1 | 5v push-pull output |\nL74: | 24 | LS9 | Passthrough to MCU |\nL75: | 25 | LS10 | Passthrough to MCU |\nL76: | 26 | LS11 | Passthrough to MCU |\nL77: | 27 | LS12 | Passthrough to MCU |\nL78: | 28 | LS13 | Lowside output |\n"
